# Host skill directories bind-mounted (live, read-write) into Pi's global
# skills dir (/home/pi/.pi/agent/skills/<name>). Pi's edits write back here.
# One absolute path per line.
# '#' comments and blank lines ignored. Leading ~ expands to $HOME.
# Edit with `tau skills`; recreate the container (tau stop && tau start) to
# pick up adds/removes.
#
# Example — share skills you keep on your host machine:
# ~/.claude/skills/voice
# ~/.claude/skills/review-pull-request
# ~/my-skills/some-skill
